{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29827","headline":"赋得桃李无言 · 李商隐","name":"赋得桃李无言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夭桃花正发，穠李蘂方繁。\n应候非争艳，成蹊不在言。\n静中霞暗吐，香处雪潜翻。\n得意摇风态，含情泣露痕。\n芬芳光上苑，寂默委中园。\n赤白徒自许，幽芳谁与论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29827.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29827","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}